  <item>
    <title>Vol.181【禾下乘凉梦】一日三餐，好好吃饭</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61860b517dda6235dcb73b87</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61860b517dda6235dcb73b87</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Nov 2021 04:57:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>爷爷走的那天长沙下起小雨</span><br><span>爷爷总说：“我有一梦，叫做‘禾下乘凉梦’。”</span><br><span></span><br><span>“我们的水稻有高粱那么高，</span><br><span>穗子有扫帚那么长，</span><br><span>籽粒有花生米那么大，</span><br><span>我看着好高兴，坐到稻穗下乘凉。”</span><br><span></span><br><span>谨以此纪念袁老的离开</span><br><span>也愿世界上的人们 一日三餐 不再挨饿 好好吃饭 好好生活</span><br><span></span><br><span>R·I·P</span><br><span></span><br><span>But you're already gone——Xeuphoria</span><br><span>送别——LunaLiu刘不语</span></p>]]></description>
